    {"passage", R"REF(title: none | text: Chapter one. The lighthouse keeper climbed the spiral stairs each evening at dusk, counting the steps as he went. There were one hundred and twelve of them, worn smooth in the middle by a century of boots. At the top he trimmed the wick, polished the great lens until it shone, and watched the first ships of the night turn toward the harbour, their lanterns small and steady against the dark water. Chapter two. The lighthouse keeper climbed the spiral stairs each evening at dusk, counting the steps as he went. There were one hundred and twelve of them, worn smooth in the middle by a century of boots. At the top he trimmed the wick, polished the great lens until it shone, and watched the first ships of the night turn toward the harbour, their lanterns small and steady against the dark water. Chapter three. The lighthouse keeper climbed the spiral stairs each evening at dusk, counting the steps as he went. There were one hundred and twelve of them, worn smooth in the middle by a century of boots. At the top he trimmed the wick, polished the great lens until it shone, and watched the first ships of the night turn toward the harbour, their lanterns small and steady against the dark water. Chapter four. The lighthouse keeper climbed the spiral stairs each evening at dusk, counting the steps as he went. There were one hundred and twelve of them, worn smooth in the middle by a century of boots. At the top he trimmed the wick, polished the great lens until it shone, and watched the first ships of the night turn toward the harbour, their lanterns small and steady against the dark water. )REF", {2, 3250, 236787, 7293, 1109, 1816, 236787, 11503, 886, 236761, 669, 63937, 64222, 54264, 506, 32450, 31393, 1546, 9137, 657, 85083, 236764, 23513, 506, 6555, 618, 668, 3939, 236761, 2085, 964, 886, 7549, 532, 22778, 529, 1091, 236764, 23143, 7080, 528, 506, 6029, 684, 496, 7691, 529, 22648, 236761, 2640, 506, 1903, 668, 70741, 506, 97434, 236764